铜锅装着上桌视觉效果也不错，两个人点这两份其实已经挺有饱腹感了。\n\n价格方面人均大概 30～40 元，在商场里算比较正常，想吃米线、泡饭或者云南口味，又不想吃得太贵的话，可以来试试。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/iiVEe-zGvb1fZGjUTdW2jTp6o1XoKQrw-adZgEWmh3IpTzNcvPV8fL5FTH2R6noGElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/2cbndLclxZkx2tGjap7k5s_u7y7VuRkThbvnUzzh7fYtrdA1mIehlM5omzzIA_5SElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/-NcAUTtuENhSML3BuqY1Uu5-7K2_EJWAnVokb3-WsYRmgkF2GqHl39a3VFFh7YzuElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3490447165","user":"张**","time":"10月6日","star":5,"text":"陆悦天地逛了很多次，第一次吃这家店，鸡汤米线，量足味美，还会再来","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/VLlpi0zo8KSgLzFi6UogP_AwzqZ73DQEA3dZDIX3Ze3LF63Iiymxfmi8Ymq70ojjElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3489324334","user":"秋**","time":"10月6日","star":3.5,"text":"炎热的夏天没什么胃口，下班路过这家店。野生鸡汤泡饭，感觉清淡又鲜美。一看大众上有团购优惠。于是尝一尝这家的味道如何？菌汤很鲜美，鸡肉丝也很嫩滑，还配着各种菌菇。加上了几块碎锅巴，有嚼起来脆脆的。麻椒鸡又麻又辣，不过很下饭。水煮菜过于清淡了一些，不过适合减脂的人群。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Sdmo2tlrl5EwriBK6mGqQCnKEXP-3LLYUc0pDwWFr8dG7IRfHv3usi9IqNBdPmRFElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/zE5-KNvSV9TEqcteno75QmAQ6CsFLfZUFFbxESPb8s9gdba2yeMsJc8kDkidKbwBElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/fnPmm28Hb4hlDdNf_cI3n0bBUDs-_TWyAnlvr3GO0rXS8CWkZmdNZ7rahciGzYJgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3486995329","user":"j**","time":"10月5日","star":4,"text":"鸡汤米线清清淡淡的，适合小朋友吃。小锅米线和鸡麻鸡口味比较重，好吃。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/bixYh_IfTpEgpIHWa4t22tSl8XaX4iBWhHEe1w-5BwIcngnD7AK_sjqEk8UX47ZKElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/hgrKuz7eFXdB0f9meKRu6jmwNuY0hvxRj-zOZdNi7E02xSwXFkFZJ6KajDEPAnXeElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/BsN6jNa3E1VzoE5vjt5nIv0ALdAb2U0bHJJv6v0FFyoZ1fMPbZpMMgsiWYkmZHH_Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xm