D22Hm95raPYBNfqIIXTmf_QXaugRuABrbYKHSiZqIPElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ZEif8egz-gwvChqFWiJ2oRGfNMK04B25dOlMzWXWE_NjFQ4I3TXUHw47-Hm63Le5Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/p0Deekw1KYTS9UyyDUWSjXSA_P-hL_np2EgiaTlvNLX2a-S16Sj3VegA9-KO81fVElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3473832372","user":"越**","time":"9月29日","star":3.5,"text":"我觉得定位把他定做普通的午餐的话就还行\n因为看到招牌是云南菜就进来吃了，但是我觉得他的口味真的很清淡\n口味：「野生菌鸡汤饭」就是一盆鸡汤加一勺饭，旁边是菌菇和一些鸡肉，吃出了健康的感觉（并非）\n首先是鸡汤没什么鲜味，很普通的鸡汤，菌菇和鸡肉就这样，如果饭上的锅巴（炒米）能多一点的话应该吃起来会幸福感高一点。\n大意就是没啥好吃的，鸡汤泡饭也就真的就是鸡汤加饭，没有那种泡开的感觉。饭如其名，没有意料之外的感觉。\n\n口味：「黑松露牛肝菌焖饭」这个就是一小碗焖饭，说实话吃起来真的蛮无聊的，就是一锅饭\n口味：小酥肉还炸的蛮酥脆的，这个可以给个好评\n\n店员服务有点刚来的感觉，问店员要个酱油，他说酱油是生抽吗，然后点单的时候里面有选项是加麻，原来就是店员直接端着一罐花椒油上来说你自己放两勺，一会罐子我再给你拿走。反正就是说不上来什么不好，但是总感觉很草台班子","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ert3y2xWHE_O40xOsnMjv1DzAW9XotEpBfgeZyH4fDFVlWljddN3bZOKsp2bk72eElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/-iuvZXbWnTcsENFxPMBgAqiwsJbcRmcwYTq0VHyMdUqJwWnuAhQ4z7NzJv58t46-Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/KGrpJjcvCKuTBlbbVPdtA3Tf1LqWntTXNtcwBioMvFdvi0P_Dtr6w5cCvcM55FcMElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://p0.meituan.net/coverpic/0147126829212cd5a1fbf2c34018cab7377806.jpg%40400w_400h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3473776595","user":"独**","time":"9月29日","star":5,"text":"店内环境很好，套餐很划算，菜品新鲜，鸡汤好喝，菌菇应该比较新鲜","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3473738081","user":"匿**","time":"9月29日","star":5,"text":"很香，汤泡饭很好吃，有种云南的味道，小「鸡腿」卤得也很透彻。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/RCYsKMDOJqbfECCbvmOXqSCfBLpp3FtSDVlnKBoA_WWRsA91qaea4DILH6Ueyac0Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/hrPbqlyAhTF5m_yIxtQFR7VGtUrD0wMVQZVoknrFXtPqT_Y6g4dKKzrjfwAlzQ8kElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/R5gxPIAnYuO5sqnT5kGwZyFpK5f_aZp1zonum49t